00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:51.120
I'm saying this is your children compared to Jamie and Mark.

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:59.840
Since the universe has something bigger in store for them.

00:09:01.530 --> 00:09:03.870
But there's a destiny that needs to be fulfilled.

00:09:04.070 --> 00:09:07.800
The accident happened here, in Busan.

00:09:08.080 --> 00:09:11.740
You could say it was written in the stars.

00:09:40.460 --> 00:09:47.220
General Zandra, did you find out when we will reach Terra Erto?

