He's a traitor.

00:10:52.350 --> 00:10:52.410
He's a traitor.

00:10:52.770 --> 00:10:59.340
He's a traitor.

00:11:00.250 --> 00:11:15.060
I don't know how to do it, but I don't know how to do it, but I don't know how to do it.

00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:54.900
