00:13:28.860 --> 00:13:29.340
Maybe...

00:13:31.790 --> 00:13:35.980
What we should ask is if he has a family on this planet.

00:13:38.860 --> 00:13:40.790
That won't happen far, Joffrey.

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:45.560
Especially since your father is a terrorist.

00:13:47.760 --> 00:13:52.510
