00:17:34.020 --> 00:17:35.920
Big Bert and I, we don't have any wounds.

00:17:36.360 --> 00:17:37.040
We don't have any scars.

00:17:37.560 --> 00:17:39.610
So, I think the people who are with us,

00:17:39.690 --> 00:17:40.170
