00:18:31.200 --> 00:18:34.750
It must be the vaccines and booster shots

00:18:34.750 --> 00:18:36.170
that you were given when you were young.

00:18:36.530 --> 00:18:40.520
But those are all to protect us from diseases, Ma.

00:18:40.640 --> 00:18:43.570
Not to be bulletproof.

00:18:44.010 --> 00:18:44.870
And bulletproof.

00:18:48.690 --> 00:18:54.290
Okay, so we made an experimental vaccine,

00:18:54.610 --> 00:18:57.070
Dr. Smith and your father back then,

00:18:57.070 --> 00:18:59.620
that can add...

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:01.420
strength in a person's body.

00:19:01.640 --> 00:19:04.500
And when we saw that it was successful,

00:19:05.140 --> 00:19:07.500
we told you.

00:19:08.860 --> 00:19:09.580
Because, you know,

00:19:10.990 --> 00:19:13.710
Dr. Smith and your father

00:19:13.710 --> 00:19:14.070
were already planning

00:19:14.070 --> 00:19:14.930
for you to be involved

00:19:14.930 --> 00:19:16.270
in the Earth Defense Force.

00:19:16.670 --> 00:19:20.100
We are the only ones who were given the vaccine.

00:19:20.380 --> 00:19:21.980
I have others.

00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:29.560
All to that project,

00:19:30.160 --> 00:19:36.580
when we saw that you can use that extra strength in other people's personal interests.

00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:47.660
So, that's why you're not being bullied by other girls and you don't get hurt easily.

00:19:47.850 --> 00:19:49.850
Why are you a genius?

00:19:50.470 --> 00:19:55.140
This is just between us, don't tell anyone else.

00:19:56.310 --> 00:19:59.850
Also, I want to know the name of the soldier who shot you in order to...

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:01.060
I will support Commander Robinson.

00:20:01.480 --> 00:20:05.160
T.S. Little John.

00:20:05.780 --> 00:20:09.520
If this is the case, Ma, why don't you let me join the training?

00:20:09.820 --> 00:20:13.620
We are not having this conversation again, Little Man.

00:20:13.980 --> 00:20:15.030
Eat your food.

00:20:15.190 --> 00:20:16.550
Come on, it's your favorite apple, right?

00:20:17.340 --> 00:20:18.850
Eat more, okay?

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:20.110
Are you going to eat?

00:20:20.830 --> 00:20:22.280
I don't need it.

00:20:22.990 --> 00:20:23.210
Just check.

00:20:37.960 --> 00:20:42.680
Do you think it's possible that the cause is just an experimental vaccine and that's why we're bulletproof and bug-bug free?

00:20:43.060 --> 00:20:47.990
Why? Are you doubting that Mama is lying?

00:20:48.590 --> 00:20:52.550
No, Big Bert. I'm just asking for your opinion, okay?

00:20:52.850 --> 00:20:59.600
Because you won. You're not a pharmaceutical scientist.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:00.980
Mama and Dr. Smith.

00:21:03.030 --> 00:21:05.670
Astrophysics is Mama's specialization.

00:21:07.220 --> 00:21:10.680
Robotics and Aeronautics is Dr. Smith's expertise.

00:21:10.680 --> 00:21:17.600
And Papa and I, they're already eager to create medicine or vaccine.

00:21:18.140 --> 00:21:20.790
Exactly. Exactly. That's what I've been thinking about.

00:21:21.310 --> 00:21:23.420
Well, you two are smart.

00:21:24.320 --> 00:21:25.400
Especially this one.

00:21:25.540 --> 00:21:27.120
Oh, sharp, Teresine.

00:21:28.610 --> 00:21:29.270
Big Bert.

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:35.300
Don't get my point. I'm just saying that Mama is hiding something from us, okay?

00:21:35.790 --> 00:21:40.790
That's why she can't explain why we're different. Get it?

00:21:41.070 --> 00:21:46.160
That's in our genes, brother. That's the only logical scientific reason.

00:21:46.480 --> 00:21:50.080
The answer to all your questions is in our genes.

00:22:05.980 --> 00:22:10.380
I hope you have good news.

00:22:10.620 --> 00:22:15.060
We have already done what you asked us to do.

00:22:15.060 --> 00:22:15.160
We?

00:22:17.130 --> 00:22:20.980
Why do we have to be the only ones forced to do things

00:22:20.980 --> 00:22:23.090
so that we can build an army?

00:22:25.290 --> 00:22:27.170
Using my different skills,

00:22:27.920 --> 00:22:29.760
I have strengthened the energy I use.

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:31.600
We will use it for the machine of pulse.

00:22:31.740 --> 00:22:33.440
I don't need any explanation, Detective.

00:22:33.820 --> 00:22:37.700
We will be able to travel faster.

00:22:37.780 --> 00:22:40.620
We will reach Terra Air 2 within a month.

00:22:43.420 --> 00:22:51.010
I hope you will listen to my request.

00:22:51.170 --> 00:22:58.820
Planet Terra Air 2.

00:23:00.540 --> 00:23:02.640
Just a moment, and you will see.

00:23:04.710 --> 00:23:06.710
This is the truth that I have been seeking.

00:23:07.950 --> 00:23:22.730
This is Five Legacy.

00:23:22.970 --> 00:23:26.120
I told you, you can't hide the truth.

00:23:26.760 --> 00:23:27.950
What do you want me to do?

00:23:28.090 --> 00:23:29.130
Confess to my kids.

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:31.380
Where did their father really come from?

00:23:31.640 --> 00:23:34.760
The kids have the right to know their real identity.

00:23:35.160 --> 00:23:38.900
Are you afraid of anger and anger in your children?

00:23:39.380 --> 00:23:42.030
