00:24:00.120 --> 00:24:02.140
Will you let me join your training, Ma?

00:24:02.260 --> 00:24:05.140
It's too early to lose track of their technology.

00:24:05.720 --> 00:24:07.360
General Drakko, prepare the army.

00:24:07.600 --> 00:24:10.360
I want you to train our new soldiers.

00:24:10.700 --> 00:24:14.400
